402	Late Wind
403	A spear found stuck in the island's edge the day the bridges broke. That day's wind still clings to it.
404	Twin Winds
405	Two blades, said to be found one on each side of a split island. Touch them together and they whistle.
406	Hawkeye
407	A crossbow left by an old falconer. Draw the string and far things look near.
408	Dawn Bellringer
409	The morning the bridges broke, people heard this hammer's bell and fled inland.
410	Little Cloud Fan
411	A wisp of cloud tangled on the tip of the staff Solbaram used as a child.
412	Millkeeper's Cap
413	The cap of someone who polished the windmill every day, even after the wind died.
414	Dandelion Wanderer
415	Wanderer's Hood
416	Wanderer's Cloak
417	Wanderer's Sandals
418	Fluffling
419	A ball of fur matted with dust from beneath the clouds. Swarms in packs and bites.
420	Thornseed
421	A withered pod sprouting red thorns. Rams you with its gaping mouth.
422	Windthief
423	A ragged black-feathered bird that flies on stolen wind. Its hits drain your wind.
424	Fluffling Chief
425	A huge fluffling that ate the whole field's wind alone. Wears a horned crown and commands flufflings.
426	Mud Fluffling
427	A fluffling caked in swamp mud. Slow, but tough and bites hard.
428	Bog Pod
429	A pod hiding among the reeds. Spits mud clumps from a distance.
430	Heron Chick
431	Gray chicks led by the Great Heron. They dive in flocks.
432	Great Heron
433	A giant gray bird that landed on Nest Isle the day the great wind stopped. It hoards the island's last wind under its wings.
434	Nestkeeper
435	A shelled beast guarding a murkling nest. It withers the ground around the nest. Defeat it and the nest is cleared.
